# B6 hosts statement gate: cut checks

Tool: `bash <S>/tools/leanelab.sh <S>/wt-g5b6 <S>/oleans-f8 <file>` (a direct `lean` call
inside the worktree, no `-o`, no olean written). Worktree: the read-only checkout `wt-g5b6`
at campaign commit `1781a230d2410ae2a09fbb961fe644512a6ba3c0` (the worktree's HEAD file); olean snapshot `oleans-f8`
(all of TCSlib at that commit, and Mathlib). Toolchain `leanprover/lean4:v4.25.0`.
<OUT> is this pack's scratch directory, <S> the scratchpad. Run: 2026-10-14 03:23 UTC.

## 1. Landing: the parts placed, the asserted edits applied

`python3 -I <OUT>/scripts/gate.py land <OUT>/B6Hosts.lean <S>/wt-g5b6 <OUT>/scripts/edits.py
<OUT>/work` writes the five new modules (copyright, the part's imports, the standard options,
the part verbatim) and the eight patched existing files (each part placed as its header says,
then the edits of `edits.py`, each asserted to match exactly once).
